---
pagination:
    data: termsZhHant
    size: 1
    alias: terms
permalink: zh-Hant/terms/{{ terms.term.value | lastSegment }}/index.html
---
<h1> {{ terms.termLabel.value }}</h1>
<em>術語</em>
<h3> {{ terms.description.value}} </h3>
<dl>
{% if terms.wikidata_correlate.value %}
    <dt><strong>維基數據關聯</strong></dt>
        <dd>
            <a target="_blank" href="https://wikidata.org/wiki/{{ terms.wikidata_correlate.value }}">{{ terms.wikidata_correlate.value }}</a><br>
        </dd>
{% endif %}
    <dt><strong>具有術語的實體： "{{ terms.termLabel.value }}"</strong></dt>
    <dd>
        {% for item in referencedBy %}
            <a href="/zh-Hant/{{ item.resource.value | firstSlash }}">{{ item.resourceLabel.value }}</a><br>
        {% endfor %}
    </dd>
</dl>
